{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally goes on a Safari"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Nature Around Us"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Nature Around Us > Safari"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Language of Advertising "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Imperative form to give an order, a warning, advice, and to make a request.</br> Advertisers often use Imperatives to create excitement. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Book your trip today!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Enjoy delicious meals!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Experience Mother Nature!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To make the Imperative, you use the base form of the verb. You do not use a subject. </br>The verb is at the beginning of the sentence, so it is stressed."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Geographic Features"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about geographical features, you talk about natural things like bodies of water, plants, and how the land looks."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Geographic features include things like:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"desert\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img01.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mountain\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img02.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the bush\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img03.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"river\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img04.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hill\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img05.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"island\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img06.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"delta\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img07.jpg\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "safari"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a trip to see wild animals, especially in Africa"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to go on a safari."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when traveling."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "unforgettable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you will never forget"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This will be an unforgettable trip!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "untouched "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not changed or affected in any way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is a place that is untouched by man."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the bush"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of land that is free of humans; wild"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  We are in the bush of southern Africa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "jeep"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of car made for traveling over rough ground"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Drive in an open jeep through Africa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to accompany"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go somewhere with someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A guide will accompany you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "armed guard"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a guard who carries a gun"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: An armed guard will accompany the jeep."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "luxury tent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large shelter that consists of a sheet of white canvas supported by poles and ropes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Relax in your own luxury tent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "base camp"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the main campsite which provides supplies, shelter, and communications for people on a safari "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you get lost, meet us at the base camp."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "delta"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of low land where a river spreads into many smaller rivers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Explore the deltas of Africa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob01aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le08ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a country in Africa."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short ad (30-40 words) for a safari in that country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember to use Imperatives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your ad aloud to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to their ad."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about travel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use Imperatives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use geographic features."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my ad aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le08ob01re2vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "Do you want to go on an adventure? Visit an island? What about a 5-day African safari?\nBook your safari now!\n<br>You will experience 5 unforgettable days on safari in the bush of southern Africa.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "See Africa's \"Big Five\" in a place where nature is still untouched by modern man.\n<br/>Drive in an open jeep and walk through the wild bush. A guide and an armed guard will accompany you.", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": ""}, {"text": "Relax in your own luxury tent at base camp. Enjoy excellent meals prepared by expert chefs.\nAll this and more is waiting for you in Botswana's Okavango Delta!", "id": 3, "time": "27500", "image": ""}, {"text": "Which animals do you hope to see? <br>Call us today at 267 309 3379 or send an e-mail to wildlife@gaberonetours.com with your name and telephone number to receive more information!", "id": 4, "time": "40000", "image": ""}]}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "static", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_ov